{"id":"conv_04768","context":"A uni intern interviews a manager about treasury basics","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["ren_uni","yuki_office"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Sorry to bother you when you're busy, but may I ask a bit about the treasury department's work?","jp":"お忙しいところすみません、財務部の業務について少しお話を伺ってもよろしいですか。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,5,11,16,17,54,75,96,259,321,730,953,2861,3553,4409,4878,5029,5780,5804,5964,9154,9209,9856,10213,11758,11824],"jpTokens":[{"s":"お忙しい","r":"おいそがしい","w":11824},{"s":"ところ","w":96},{"s":"すみません","w":5029},{"s":"、"},{"s":"財務","r":"ざいむ","w":4409},{"s":"部","r":"ぶ","w":321},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"業務","r":"ぎょうむ","w":953},{"s":"について","w":75},{"s":"少し","r":"すこし","w":259},{"s":"お話","r":"おはなし","w":730},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"伺っ","r":"うかがっ","w":11758},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"よろしい","w":3553},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"yuki_office","mood":null,"en":"Of course, that's fine. Actually, I just moved here in this spring's personnel reshuffle myself.","jp":"もちろん、いいですよ。私もこの春の人事異動でこの部署に来たばかりなんですけどね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,7,8,11,17,21,26,31,38,51,68,81,109,335,406,779,1519,3198,3602,4487,6641,6863,6947,7418,7743],"jpTokens":[{"s":"もちろん","w":335},{"s":"、"},{"s":"いい","w":81},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"私","r":"わたし","w":38},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"この","w":31},{"s":"春","r":"はる","w":1519},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"人事","r":"じんじ","w":3198},{"s":"異動","r":"いどう","w":7743},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"この","w":31},{"s":"部署","r":"ぶしょ","w":6947},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"来","r":"き","w":779},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ばかり","w":406},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"けど","w":109},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Oh, I see. Finance is a totally different field from labor management, isn't it?","jp":"そうなんですね。財務というと、労務管理とはまた全然違う分野ですよね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,9,17